    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents the context that a linker has when linking a module into a runtime <ref refid="d1/df8/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1runtime_1_1_container" kindref="compound">Container</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The context provides answers from the point of view of the module being linked, i.e. from some &quot;this&quot; module&apos;s point of view <ndash/> including information (like version) about this module, what other modules (and what versions of those modules) are available in the container, and what named link-time options are specified. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
